<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - DAOU started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - DAOU started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it initiated coverage of DAOU Systems Inc as a strong buy.</p>
<p>-- DAOU launched its initial public offering on Feb 12. Alex. Brown served as the lead underwriter.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.  </p>
<p>-- Alex. Brown later said it set a nine-to-12 month price target of $14 a share.</p>
<p>-- set a 1998 earnings estimate of $0.47 a share.</p>
</text>
